

    <section class="team">

      <div class="container-fluid">
          <h1>TEAM CIRCULAR</h1>
          <div class="row">

            <div class="col-md-3 text-center">
                <div class="profile">
                  <%# <img src="massimo galeotti.jpg" class="user"> %>
                  <%= image_tag "massimo galeotti.jpg", class: "user" %>
                  "I’ve always wanted to change the world. Circular was born from this, from the desire to change the world for the better. I firmly believe that owning items has become a luxury for the few. We created Circular to allow people to own everything without necessarily having it. Circular wants to give the user the pleasure of enjoying things without the requirement of ownership."
                  <h3>Massimo Galeotti <span>ITA</span></h3>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-3 text-center">
                <div class="profile">
                  <%# <img src="environment.png" class="user"> %>
                  <%= image_tag "Peter.jpg", class: "user" %>
                  "As Jane Goodall said, 'The greatest danger to our future is apathy.' Sustainability is our only way forward. Circular is a crucial step towards a true sharing economy."
                  <h3>Peter Westman <span>USA</span></h3>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-3 text-center">
                <div class="profile">
                  <%# <img src="environment.jpg" class="user"> %>
                  <%= image_tag "Fernando.jpg", class: "user" %>
                  "We need to rethink the way we consume. Our society buys so many products which after a brief period of use end up in landfills. It is worth finding a way to extend the life of those products and put them back in circulation. We must try to solve the threat posed by increased waste. Our planet needs it and so do all of us."
                  <h3>Fernando Lazzarin <span>BRZ</span></h3>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-3 text-center">
                <div class="profile">
                  <%# <img src="environment.jpg" class="user"> %>
                  <%= image_tag "Davide.jpg", class: "user" %>
                  "Technology is not doing enough to preserve the environment. The only way through is to achieve a circular approach to resources... Something that we plan to do at Circular."
                  <h3>Davide Varni <span>ITA</span></h3>
                </div>
            </div>


          </div>
      </div>
    </section>





























































